OL,3,GNEWSATip to reopen as cash
OL,4,A'disinvested' from arts fund
OL,5,
OL,6,FBradford Council's leadership is
OL,7,Fpushing ahead with plans to divert
OL,8,F#400,000 earmarked for arts and culture
OL,9,Fevents to reopen a household waste
OL,10,Frecycling centre.
OL,12,FSugden End Household Waste Recycling
OL,13,FCentre is now expected to reopen before
OL,14,Fthe end of the year, while bank holiday
OL,15,Fopening will also be restored at
OL,16,Frecycling centres across the district.
OL,18,FThe tip near Keighley was one of three
OL,19,Fclosed by the previous Labour-run
OL,20,Fadministration in 2024 as part of wider
OL,21,Fcost-cutting measures.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
